  "T:TheTetraWaveFootprintcanbepe": {
   "x": 149,
   "y": 698,
   "w": 696,
   "h": 176,
   "html": "<p style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 20px;\">The Tetra-Wave \"Footprint\" can be perfectly superimposed onto an orthogonal</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 20px;\">2-dimensional Grid with an 11:11 ratio...</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 20px;\">where each grid square equals the core diameter of \"1\".</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 20px;\">This then results in a overall Diameter of the waveform perimeter as 9 Grid Squares. Amazingly, the centroids of each TOT Pair are in a PHI relationship to each other along the vector lines tangent to the Core equaling the golden mean ratio of1.6180.</p>",
   "t": 1794090874213
  }
 },
