   "html": "<h3 class=\"ph ph-wix\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Rotation Angle relative to a horizontal plane = \u221a2/3.</span></h3><h3 class=\"ph ph-wix\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Around Median of Bottom Hedral (Face) of 1st TOT</span></h3><h3 class=\"ph ph-wix\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color: rgb(220, 220, 220); font-family: &quot;Source Sans 3&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">In Egyptian Mathematics, the fraction 2/3 is considered a special, if not, Sacred Number related to the idea of \"UNITY\" ... \"Zero\" was not used. Quantities would be expressed as some fraction of Unity.</span></h3>",
   "t": 1794138770997
