  "NT:mw9c7x9py6n1": {
   "x": 500,
   "y": 409,
   "w": 394.5,
   "h": 560,
   "html": "<h3 class=\"ph\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 0.7; text-wrap: wrap;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px; font-family: var(--body);\">I first saw Tetrahedrons as discrete forms in the biography of Alexander Graham Bell, \"Genius At Work\".&nbsp; At first I built kites like his (A lot of Fun!) but then many years later in 1985 after reading Synergetics by Buckminster Fuller I became fascinated with his theoretical framework of \"Nature's Geometry\"....instead of an X,Y,Z Cartesian coordinate system.&nbsp; When I saw his Tetrahelix model with the EXTERNAL surfaces of warped planes crossing the edges in SYNERGETICS...I was intrigued! I doubted the specifics of his DNA theory....but felt there was a connection somewhere. Whereas Bucky was created warped planes on the exterior, I started exploring the INTERIOR, crossing vectors from the centroids and vertices and created the FIRST TETRAWAVE model using wooden dowels and colored threads of Red and Blue for the vectors. The Interpenetrating surfaces of Twin HYPARS emerged including the unexpected center core channel. Years later in 2008, I explored 3D models with my architectural software and discovered that the CENTROIDs described a helical path very similar to the Sugar and Phosphate Backbone of the DNA . I hypothesized that the 4 nitrogenous bases formed guided by the fractal structure of the Tetrahelix at higher frequencies as an informational template...that it was the perfect 3D Bio-energtic Template for DNA information to be stored.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></h3>",
   "new": "text",
   "t": 1794246933750
  },
